A kids' investing game from Stephenuffugus/Mainstreet (v1.0.0-rc1).
Vendored by scripts/vendor_satellites.mjs (new MANIFEST entry, selftest
counts 13/14), carded in FEATURED at /satellites/mainstreet/?v=20261011a
with beta:true, a search alias, and a 33 KB thumbnail.

Checks: vendor --check CLEAN, --selftest 11 ok, exit audit PASS for
mainstreet (its Home button calls SWS_EXIT; referrer fallback then
/portal/), sw_cache_scope_check SCOPED (deletes only mainstreet-*),
advertised_count_check all true, portal inline scripts parse. The carded
exit audit is red on main already for other satellites; untouched here.

No earn moments, by the Director's ruling: the page posts only
sws:ready and sws:close, and carries no Sunbeam SDK or music include.

